From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn <tyn@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:46:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: show the overlay hint and update toasts only for games
 with the overlay

Upstream (since the toast notifications, 415af23) pushes the "open the overlay" hint and starts the update check
right after a game profile is loaded, for every game. Building a toast shapes its text with the overlay's
notification font, but that font (Profile::Overlay) is only configured when the profile has GameFeature::Overlay.
For every other profile (cc, mo6tw, rne, darling, dash, mo8, sg-pc, mo6tw-pc*, ...) the font is an empty
std::optional and the game crashes on start (null dereference in ExternalFont::ShapeLine) as long as the Hints
notifications are enabled, which is the default.

Show the hint and run the update check only when the profile has the overlay feature, as the achievement toasts
already require GameFeature::Achievements. Generic fix, can be submitted upstream.

Checked on MuMu (Android 15): sg-pc started and crashed 2 s after "Start apprication" with the default
EnabledNotifications; with this change it starts.

diff --git a/src/main.cpp b/src/main.cpp
index 6556b00b008dc3955b07a7bde3280b75716b5335..31f59218ea22e0c90c974cb5bb4433210204f098 100644
--- a/src/main.cpp
+++ b/src/main.cpp
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #include "util.h"
 
 #include "profile/profile.h"
+#include "profile/game.h"
 #include "userconfig.h"
 #include "io/physicalfilestream.h"
 #include "io/filemeta.h"
@@ -287,8 +288,12 @@ int main(int argc, char* argv[]) {
       Game::InitGameProfile();
 
 #ifndef IMPACTO_DISABLE_IMGUI
-      ShowOverlayHint();
-      CheckForUpdates();
+      // The toast notifications need the overlay profile (font, background),
+      // which is only configured for games with the Overlay feature
+      if (+Profile::Game::GameFeatures & +GameFeature::Overlay) {
+        ShowOverlayHint();
+        CheckForUpdates();
+      }
 #endif
     }
     t = SDL_GetPerformanceCounter();
